              "text": "Stop spending hundreds on skincare trying to fix acne scars, you are wasting your money\u2026. \n\nIf you\u2019ve been following my progress, my biggest lesson after 10 years of acne scar treatments: identify your scar type FIRST, then choose the treatment. Different acne scars require completely different approaches, for most of the scars, it can see a huge improvement after doing subcision with a filler like PLLA, followed by a few session of resurfacing laser that stimulates collagen.\n\nComment \u201cSCAR\u201d and I\u2019ll share where I get my treatments done.\n\n#acnescars #acnescartreatment #subcision",
