              "text": "Acne may heal. The scars it leaves behind often need a more personalised approach.\n\nAt The Image, acne scar treatments are selected based on the type, depth and severity of the scarring. From advanced laser procedures to collagen-stimulating treatments and targeted scar correction, the goal is to improve skin texture and support smoother, more even-looking skin.\n\nBecause no two acne scars are exactly the same, the right treatment plan starts with the right assessment.\n\nBook your consultation with The Image.\n\n\ud83d\udccd Sarjapura | Sahakara Nagar | Whitefield\n\ud83d\udcde +00 0000 0000\n\n#AcneScarTreatment #AcneScars #SkinTreatment #Dermatology",
